{"version":1,"key":"card:553","content":{"id":553,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5d92645d-bbc9-46ab-9635-e5e2d9c6440b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在为笔记软件的高亮添加背景时，为了显示出具有手写马克笔划线的高亮效果，使用了 CSS Houdini 技术来绘制背景"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"b1080a4f-2cf7-45b5-a3dc-6bf0a0a8c2a9","collabId":"1888d08d-a706-464a-bb07-c1c5a43487b8","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// marker-painter.ts\nclass MarkerPainter {\n  static get inputProperties() {\n    return [\n      \"--marker-color\",\n      \"--marker-offset\",\n      \"--marker-roughness\",\n    ];\n  }\n\n  paint(ctx, geom, props) {\n    // xxx\n  }\n}\n\nregisterPaint(\"marker-highlight\", MarkerPainter);"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"163b42fd-bd1a-422c-af7e-806ba6c4a5e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在使用前需要使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"CSS.paintWorklet.addModule(moduleURL)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行注册，如方法参数签名所见，它接受一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"URL"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 而不是直接 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"import"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 得到的对象，根据 Vite 的文档，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"?url"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获得模块的路径，或者通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"?raw"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获取到代码，然后创建 Blob URL"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"e0c3fe2e-b910-4ef0-ab2a-502c1a2d52dc","collabId":"36cfa9d0-436e-4f10-810d-1d3788ce7c41","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"import workletURL from \"./marker-painter.ts?url\";\nCSS.paintWorklet.addModule(workletURL);"},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"034e142e-5c87-45a2-9285-905ac9a60f3d","collabId":"2e1ed04a-bdf7-4175-a2ac-af22b73b123f","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"import workletCode from \"./marker-painter.ts?raw\";\nconst blob = new Blob([workletCode], { type: \"application/javascript\" });\nCSS.paintWorklet.addModule(URL.createObjectURL(blob));"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"cfac731e-6dae-4586-997d-c355f29d9334","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"?url"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在开发模式下没问题，但是打包构建后就不行，经过一番排查，把 ts 文件改为 js 后就能正常工作了，Vite 有点坑，这种情况居然不转译😑。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","collabId":"22b18754-bbe8-43e8-a90b-123070e11be3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"305b2b73-c049-44db-a972-fdc03829ce3f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"?raw"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 如果导入的是 TypeScript 代码，在开发模式下就会报错，我是在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"?url"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不行后尝试 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"?raw"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 才发现要把 ts 改为 js。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"4904f000-452f-446a-8f05-cd10d970a8fa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"09c5025e-5d6b-4c12-bfb0-c819871ed0fe","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"534a346c-e927-43ac-8fe2-a99ef49ce968","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"7a08f4fe-b73d-428f-b691-38dbc5bb31c4","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Worklet/addModule","openEdit":false,"collabId":"cdfcbbf6-e309-4dcc-9e34-078b6695088c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Worklet: addModule() method"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"17b1c89b-df04-461d-b434-ea9156961260","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e4bcc30f-cb3b-4b1a-894b-79b586b1328b","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://v2.vitejs.dev/guide/assets.html","openEdit":false,"collabId":"d4246fbe-2b1d-431b-b6af-418a149b08f9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Static Asset Handling"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["Vite/踩坑","踩坑/Vite","CSS/Houdini"],"createTime":1743989891466,"updateTime":1791474923026,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791474923026}}